sequenceDiagram
  %% Import in draw.io: Arrange > Insert > Advanced > Mermaid
  %% Sequence: Member purchases assets and receives library access

  actor Member
  participant UI as Marketplace UI
  participant API as Express API
  participant Auth as Auth/RBAC Middleware
  participant OrderCtrl as Order Controller
  participant Payment as Payment Provider
  participant OrderRepo as Order Repository
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Library as Library/Download Service
  participant Notif as Notification Service

  Member->>UI: Add asset to cart
  UI->>API: POST /api/cart/:assetId
  API->>Auth: Verify add_to_cart permission
  Auth-->>API: Authorized member
  API->>OrderRepo: addCartItem(user, asset)
  OrderRepo->>DB: INSERT cart_items
  DB-->>OrderRepo: Cart updated
  API-->>UI: Cart item added

  Member->>UI: Confirm checkout
  UI->>API: POST /api/orders/payment-intent
  API->>Auth: Verify purchase_asset permission
  API->>OrderCtrl: Calculate cart total
  OrderCtrl->>Payment: Create payment intent
  Payment-->>OrderCtrl: client_secret / payment reference
  API-->>UI: Payment intent

  Member->>Payment: Complete payment
  Payment-->>UI: Payment success
  UI->>API: POST /api/orders
  API->>OrderRepo: createOrderFromCart(user, payment_reference)
  OrderRepo->>DB: INSERT orders and order_items
  OrderRepo->>DB: INSERT user_downloads
  OrderRepo->>DB: DELETE cart_items
  DB-->>OrderRepo: Order committed
  API->>Notif: Notify buyer and sellers
  API-->>UI: Order confirmed

  Member->>UI: Open library
  UI->>API: GET /api/library
  API->>Library: Load unlocked assets
  Library->>DB: SELECT user_downloads with assets
  DB-->>Library: Library assets
  API-->>UI: Downloadable assets

